{"sha": "8a49945cfa17193d121ad055c7514181a02e69c47fd8d6003825ebe89d97f4e9", "body": ["{\\small 自由 LC 电路的电荷与电流：每当电荷穿过零点时，电流达到峰值，", "二者相位相差四分之一周期。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{能量华尔兹}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[储存能量守恒]\\label{prop:g12:rlc-oscillations:energy}", "\\index{能量!LC 电路的}", "在理想 LC 电路中，储存的总能量", "(\\cref{prop:g12:rc-rl-circuits:energy})", "\\[", "E \\;=\\; E_C + E_L \\;=\\; \\frac{q^2}{2C} + \\tfrac12\\,L i^2", "\\;=\\; \\frac{Q_0^2}{2C} \\;=\\; \\tfrac12\\,L I_0^2", "\\]", "保持不变：$q = \\pm Q_0$ 时全部在电容器中，", "$i = \\pm I_0$ 时全部在线圈中。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "求导：$\\frac{dE}{dt} = \\frac{q}{C}\\frac{dq}{dt} +", "Li\\frac{di}{dt} = i\\left(\\frac{q}{C} + L\\frac{d^2q}{dt^2}\\right) = 0$", "由\\cref{prop:g12:rlc-oscillations:equation}可知，其值取于", "$t = 0$ 时（能量全在电容器中），以及能量全在电流中的时刻", "$q = 0$ 时 --- 由此 $\\tfrac12 L I_0^2 = Q_0^2/2C$，", "仅凭能量即可再得 $I_0 = Q_0/\\sqrt{LC}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=4.6cm, xlabel={$t/T_0$},", "    ylabel={能量 $/\\,E$}, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=0, ymax=1.3,", "    legend pos=south east]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1, samples=120] {cos(360*x)^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:1, samples=120] {sin(360*x)^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, thick, domain=0:1, samples=2] {1};", "  \\legend{$E_C$, $E_L$, $E$}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 华尔兹的一个周期：能量从极板流向线圈，", "再流回极板，每周期往返两次，总和固定为 $Q_0^2/2C$ --- 正是", "弹簧--质量振子的图，只是换了标签。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[华尔兹的测量]\\label{ex:g12:rlc-oscillations:waltz}", "$C = \\qty{1.0}{\\micro F}$ 的电容器充电至 $U_0 = \\qty{10}{V}$，然后接到", "$L = \\qty{10}{mH}$ 的线圈上：能量 $E = \\tfrac12 C U_0^2 = \\qty{5.0e-5}{J}$，", "周期 $T_0 = \\qty{0.63}{ms}$，峰值电流", "$I_0 = U_0\\sqrt{C/L} = \\qty{0.10}{A}$，于开关闭合后", "经过四分之一周期（\\qty{0.16}{ms}）时达到。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{实际电路：阻尼振荡}", "", "每个实际线圈都由有电阻的导线绕制：真实的回路是", "一个串联 \\emph{RLC} 电路，电阻会消耗能量。", "", "\\begin{definition}[准周期与非周期状态]\\label{def:g12:rlc-oscillations:regimes}", "\\index{RLC 电路}\\index{准周期状态}\\index{非周期状态}", "在串联 RLC 电路中，电阻器通过焦耳", "热效应耗散能量（见\\cref{ch:g11:circuits-and-power}）：自由振荡是", "\\emph{阻尼的}。两种状态可由示波器读出：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{准周期的}（$R$ 较小）：电路仍在", "        在逐渐缩小的包络线内振荡，并有一个重复时间 ---", "        \\emph{准周期}\\index{准周期!电学的} ---", "        在阻尼较轻时接近 $T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$；", "  \\item \\emph{非周期的}（$R$ 较大）：电荷缓慢回到零，", "        不会过冲 --- 根本不发生振荡。", "\\end{itemize}", "这恰好是阻尼机械振子", "（见\\cref{def:g12:oscillators-and-time:damping}）的精确对应。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9.2cm, height=5.2cm,", "    xlabel={$t$（\\unit{\\micro s}）}, ylabel={$u$（\\unit{V}）},", "    xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=-6.6, ymax=8.2, legend pos=north east]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:10, samples=300]", "    {6*exp(-x/3)*cos(deg(2*pi*x/1.6))};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:10, samples=100] {6*exp(-x/1.2)};", "  \\legend{准周期（$R$ 较小），非周期（$R$ 较大）}", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=0:10, samples=80, forget plot]", "    {6*exp(-x/3)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, dashed, domain=0:10, samples=80, forget plot]", "    {-6*exp(-x/3)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 实际 RLC 电路的两种归宿：振荡在", "指数型包络线（虚线）内逐渐消失，或无振荡地缓慢趋于零。", "轻阻尼时，准周期仍保持 $\\approx T_0$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[维持振荡]\\label{rem:g12:rlc-oscillations:maintain}", "\\index{维持振荡}", "要保持振幅不衰减，需向电路恰好补充", "电阻所耗散的能量，每周期补充一次，并与摆动\\emph{同步}：一个", "放大器对 RLC 回路的作用，恰如擒纵机构对单摆的推动", "（见\\cref{ch:g12:oscillators-and-time}）。每只石英表", "和每台无线电发射机都是这样的维持振荡器，以其", "固有频率 $f_0$ 工作。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{力学对应}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电学--力学对照表]\\label{prop:g12:rlc-oscillations:analogy}", "\\index{电学--力学类比}", "LC 方程即弹簧--质量方程", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:oscillators-and-time:spring-period}），逐字相同：", "\\begin{center}\\small", "\\begin{tabular}{lcl}", "LC 电路 & & 弹簧--质量滑块\\\\[2pt]", "电荷 $q$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & 位置 $x$\\\\", "电流 $i = dq/dt$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & 速度 $v = dx/dt$\\\\", "电感 $L$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & 质量 $m$\\\\", "电容的倒数 $1/C$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & 劲度系数 $k$\\\\", "电阻 $R$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & 摩擦力\\\\", "$L\\,\\frac{d^2q}{dt^2} + \\frac{q}{C} = 0$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ &", "  $m\\,\\frac{d^2x}{dt^2} + kx = 0$\\\\[2pt]", "$T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ &", "  $T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{m/k}$\\\\[2pt]", "$E_C = q^2/2C$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & $E_p = \\tfrac12 kx^2$\\\\", "$E_L = \\tfrac12 Li^2$ & $\\longleftrightarrow$ & $E_k = \\tfrac12 mv^2$", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "方程相同，解也相同：关于任一振子的结论，", "都可立即译成另一振子的语言。", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}